{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>XYZShareFile 讓使用者在同一網絡內快速傳送檔案、相片與文字，適合需要跨裝置分享內容而不欲註冊帳號的 iPhone、iPad 使用者。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-263.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>同一網絡自動配對傳輸</h2>\n<p>XYZShareFile 會自動搜尋同一網絡內的裝置，也可掃描 QR 碼配對；選定檔案、相片或文字後，由接收方確認即可完成傳輸。它支援同一批次傳送至多部裝置，並可在 History 查看確認狀態、找出未收到的項目，或匯出交接記錄。使用者亦可經系統分享面板，直接從 iPhone 或 iPad 分享檔案，全程本地傳輸且無需帳號。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-269-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-270-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-271-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-272-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-273-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-274-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：XYZShareFile</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/xyzsharefile/id6835498166?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:43:58.005755+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T03:32:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:57:33.456199+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T03:37:25.101458+00:00","content_hash":"0d81c16100f8b96410855dd6dd03ac834aec68d8d008d69b7f28b4331a3f3d39","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}